+## DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash family
+
+`families/deepseek_v41/` and its tests (`tests/*dsv41*`, `tests/cuda/*dsv41*`) are written for the
+deepseek-v41-tensorfold-spark deployment (two DGX Sparks), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Jay Leaton (text in
+[`LICENSES/MIT.txt`](LICENSES/MIT.txt)). What they follow:
+
+- The model math (CSA2 attention, the compressor and indexer, Single-Pass mHC, Engram, the MoE routing, DSpark
+  drafting, RoPE) follows vLLM's DeepSeek-V4 / V4.1 implementation (Apache License 2.0), cited per file; no code is
+  copied.
+- `tests/fixtures/dsv41_encoding_ref.py` is DeepSeek's `encoding/encoding.py` of `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash`,
+  copied unchanged as test data (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 DeepSeek). The engine's own `encoding.py` renders
+  the same prompt format and is compared with it.
+- The packed per-rank Engram shard format (`engram_host.py`) and the EXL3 pack layout are read from the files of
+  the MiaAI-Lab 2.9 bpw pack and its kit's packed shards: file-format facts only. Nothing is taken from the kit's
+  AGPL-3.0 overlay or its chat template.
